  m_Name: USAOfferDefinition
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::_Project.Scripts.Data.Offers.OfferDefinition
  OfferId: offer-tramp
  Customer: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8458ebd819267f146bcd4c46790fc19b, type: 2}
  Title: Extract and deliver 10 tons of regolith
  Description: 'Listen. Everybody wants regolith now. Everybody. The Chinese, the
    Europeans, all of them. But nobody has better energy deals than us.


    The
    United States Lunar Energy Reserve is offering a strategic partnership. Deliver
    25 units of high-quality lunar regolith to our extraction facilities and in return
    you will receive:


    access to premium Earth oil reserves,

    discounted
    fuel shipments for your lunar fleet,

    protection contracts for your mining
    operations.


    People said lunar mining would never work. We proved them wrong.


    Make
    the Moon profitable again.



    United States Lunar Energy Reserve'
